      "replacement": "  collectgarbage()  -- this collection only calls TM, without freeing memory\n  assert(collectgarbage(\"count\") >= x+10)\n  assert(udata_finalized == 1000)\n  assert(T.totalmem(\"userdata\") == udata_initial + 1000)\n  for i=1,1000 do assert(udata_seen[i] and udata_values[i] == nil) end\n  local udata_key_count = 0\n  for _ in pairs(udata_keys) do udata_key_count = udata_key_count + 1 end\n  assert(udata_key_count == 1000)",
